theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 35
text = "MAYDAY! MAYDAAAAAAY! Screw the Bananas, You ate so much that you are now in a parallel world. The only way to get out of here is ny reaching the circuit's  end before the countdown of 30s. If you FAIL to do so, you'll be closed in an infinite loop that start over and over again. 

Perhaps it's not your first time seeing this message. We are so COOOOOKED!"
